# Pony: Pony tutorial and language reference (keywords, literals); requirements/languages/pony.md
name     pony

keyword  actor class primitive struct trait interface type use fun be new var let embed if then else
keyword  elseif end while for in do repeat until match try with recover consume return break continue
keyword  error iso trn ref val box tag object where as is isnt not and or xor
type     U8 U16 U32 U64 U128 I8 I16 I32 I64 I128 F32 F64 Bool String Array None
builtin  true false this

line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */  : nested
string   """ """  : multiline
string   " "      : escapes
escape        : x=2 u4
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.
upper-type
calls
hook     apostrophe
